;;;; B3 cash equities (MIC BVMF, Listado B3). Holidays: calendars/BVMF.sexp.
;;;; The close is the end of the closing call. B3 moved the session for Brazilian summer time
;;;; (2010/11, 2011/12, 2015/16) and, from 2019, for US daylight time; each era cites its Ofício Circular.
(
 :mic "BVMF"
 :name "B3 S.A. - Brasil, Bolsa, Balcão"
 :zone "America/Sao_Paulo"
 :calendar "BVMF"
 :source "BM&FBOVESPA news and B3 Ofícios Circulares (OC) on trading hours"
 :eras (
   (:from (1990 1 2) :to (2010 10 15)
    :sessions ((:open (10 0) :close (17 0)))
    :authority "10:00-17:00 until 15/10/2010 (BM&FBOVESPA news 13/10/2010: 'Até o dia 15 de outubro, as negociações permanecem das 10 às 17h'); eras before 2010 not verified http://web.archive.org/web/2010id_/http://www.bmfbovespa.com.br/pt-br/noticias/2010/BMFBOVESPA-divulga-novos-horarios-de-negociacao-nos-segmentos-de-acoes-e-derivativos-2010-10-13.aspx")
   (:from (2010 10 18) :to (2011 3 11)
